spans.s:
√stu (staúti [626], stuté; tuṣṭā́va, tnṣṭuvé;
ástauṣīt, ástoṣṭa; ástāvīt;
staviṣyáti, -te; stoṣyáti, -te; stutá;
stótum; stutvā́; -stútya, -stū́ya; stūyáte
). praise; extol (a god); stuvánt,
(praising, as subst.) worshipper.
+ pra,
 —1. praise;
 —2. bring forward
as object of mention or subject of conversation
(cf. Lat. laudare, prop. ‘praise,’
but also ‘mention’), and so
 —3. generalized,
introduce, begin.
